go:0034061 iao:0000111 "DNA polymerase activity";
           iao:0000115 "Catalysis of the reaction: deoxynucleoside triphosphate + DNA(n) = diphosphate + DNA(n+1); the synthesis of DNA from deoxyribonucleotide triphosphates in the presence of a nucleic acid template and a 3'hydroxyl group.";
           iao:0000412 pobo:go.owl;
