iao:0000059 iao:0000111 "report figure"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000124;
            iao:0000115 "A report figure is a report display element that has some aspect of illustration, but may be a composite of figures, images, and other elements"@en;
            iao:0000116 "Replaced by defined version of figure"@en,
                        "I prepended the 'report ' to make it clear that we mean parts of reports here. We may want a more generic version of 'figure', in which case this would become a defined class - figure and part_of some report"@en;
            iao:0000117 "person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en,
                        "person:Allyson Lister"@en;
            iao:0000119 "OBI_0000027",
