            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "formal citation, e.g. identifier in external database to indicate / attribute source(s) for the definition. Free text indicate / attribute source(s) for the definition. EXAMPLE: Author Name, URI, MeSH Term C04, PUBMED ID, Wiki uri on 31.01.2007"@en;
            iao:0000117 "PERSON:Daniel Schober"@en;
