            owl:equivalentProperty [owl:inverseOf iao:0000418].
iao:0000420 iao:0000115 "A defined class is a class that is defined by a set of logically necessary and sufficient conditions but is not a universal";
            iao:0000116 """\"definitions\", in some readings, always are given by necessary and sufficient conditions. So one must be careful (and this is difficult sometimes) to distinguish between defined classes and universal.""";
            iao:0000117 "Alan Ruttenberg";
            a iao:0000409,
              owl:NamedIndividual;
            rdfs:label "defined class".
iao:0000421 iao:0000115 "A named class expression is a logical expression that is given a name. The name can be used in place of the expression.";
            iao:0000116 "named class expressions are used in order to have more concise logical definition but their extensions may not be interesting classes on their own. In languages such as OWL, with no provisions for macros, these show up as actuall classes. Tools may with to not show them as such, and to replace uses of the macros with their expansions";
            iao:0000117 "Alan Ruttenberg";
            a iao:0000409,
              owl:NamedIndividual;
            rdfs:label "named class expression".
iao:0000422 iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "A textual entity that is used as directive to deliver something to a person, or organization";
            iao:0000116 "2010-05-24 Alan Ruttenberg. Use label for the string representation. See issue https://github.com/information-artifact-ontology/IAO/issues/59";
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "postal address"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom gaz:00000448 ; 
                             owl:onProperty iao:0000136 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            iao:0000300.
iao:0000423 iao:0000115 "Terms with this status should eventually replaced with a term from another ontology."@en;
            iao:0000117 "Alan Ruttenberg"@en;
            iao:0000119 "group:OBI"@en;
            a iao:0000078,
              owl:NamedIndividual;
            rdfs:label "to be replaced with external ontology term"@en.
