iao:0000628 iao:0000111 "genome announcement textual entity"@en;
            iao:0000112 """Excerpt from Kim et al. J Bacteriol. 2011 Oct; 193(19): 5537. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3187466/):

