obi:0000026 iao:0000111 "cytological stain role";
            iao:0000112 "haemotoxylin is a general purpose nuclear stain extracted from the wood of the logwood tree WEB: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haematoxylin";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A dye role that is realized when the stain is used to colour cells and or cellular components for the purposes of visualization";
