obi:0000049 iao:0000111 "mass spectrometer"@en;
            iao:0000112 "LCQ Fleet Ion Trap MSn manufactured by thermo fisher scientific"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "A mass spectrometer is an instrument which is used to measure the mass to charge ratio of ions. All mass spectrometers consist of three basic parts: an ion source, a mass analyzer, and a detector system. The stages within the mass spectrometer are: 1. Production of ions from the sample 2. Separation of ions with different masses 3. Detection of the number of ions of each mass produced 4.Collection of data to generate the mass spectrum"@en;
            iao:0000117 "Frank Gibson"@en;
            iao:0000119 "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mass_spectrometry"@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "mass spectrometer"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000654 ; 
                             owl:onProperty pobo:RO_0000053 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            obi:0000832,
                            [owl:intersectionOf ([owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000345 ; 
                                                 owl:onProperty pobo:BFO_0000051 ; 
                                                 a owl:Restriction]
                                                 [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000361 ; 
                                                 owl:onProperty pobo:BFO_0000051 ; 
                                                 a owl:Restriction]
                                                 [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000364 ; 
                                                 owl:onProperty pobo:BFO_0000051 ; 
                                                 a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                             a owl:Class],
                            [owl:someValuesFrom [owl:unionOf (ncbitaxon:9606
                                                              obi:0000245) ; 
                                                 a owl:Class] ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000647 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000453 ; 
                             owl:onProperty pobo:RO_0000085 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction].
obi:0000050 iao:0000111 "platform"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "A platform is an object_aggregate that is the set of instruments and software needed to perform a process. definition_source: OBI."@en;
            iao:0000117 "OBI Instrument branch";
            iao:0000119 "OBI Instrument branch";
            iao:0000231 iao:0000103;
            iao:0000232 "suggested for deprecation https://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=2881353&group_id=177891&atid=886178",
                        """rem1: We decided at the Philly workshop that consumables do not include reagents.
FG: we could actully add a relation to platform which would be \"has_part some instrument\"
DS: Sounds fine to me, with the restriction that I would assume a min. cardinality of 2 to be applicable for this crossproduct, so at least 2 instruments make it a platform... at least one is not  enough
AR:has_part is transitive, and transitive properties can't have  cardinality constraints in OWL-DL. We can always put this particular  constraint in the owl-full file.

We need to make this a defined class when the class software is in the ontology"""@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "obsolete_platform"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf oboinowl:ObsoleteClass;
            owl:deprecated true.
obi:0000051 iao:0000111 "liquid chromatography mass spectrometry platform"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "A liquid chromatography mass spectrometry platform is a platform that is the collection of instrument, software and reagents needed to perform a liquid chromatography mass spectrometry protocol. definition_source: OBI."@en;
            iao:0000117 "OBI instrument branch";
            iao:0000119 "OBI Instrument branch";
            a owl:Class;
