            iao:0000232 "kind of report. (alan) need to be careful to distinguish from output of a data transformation or calculation. A gene list is a report when it is published as such? Relates to question of whether report is a whole, or whether it can be a part of some other narrative object."@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "gene list"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf iao:0000100.
