            iao:0000115 "A measurement datum measuring the minimal signal that must be detected to generate an electrical event, as compared to the maximal detected signal in a flow cytometer instrument. The datum has a qualitative role"@en;
            iao:0000117 "person:Kevin Clancy"@en;
