obi:0000174 iao:0000111 "study group role";
            iao:0000112 "The group of randomized participants that are assigned to a treatment arm of the trial";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "a study population role where the bearer is a population of material entities and the role is realized in the implementation of a study design wherein the entities bearing the study population role are observed or subjected to intervention according to the study design and are biological replicates, i.e. they receive the same treatment under the protocol"@en;
