obi:0000175 iao:0000111 "p-value"@en;
            iao:0000112 """PMID:19696660
in contrast to the in-vivo data AT-III increased significantly from
113.5% at baseline to 117% after 4 days (n = 10, P-value= 0.02; Table 2).""";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000121;
            iao:0000115 "A quantitative confidence value that represents the probability of obtaining a result at least as extreme as that actually obtained, assuming that the actual value was the result of chance alone."@en;
            iao:0000116 "May be outside the scope of OBI long term, is needed so is retained";
            iao:0000117 "PERSON:Chris Stoeckert"@en;
            iao:0000119 "WEB: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/P-value";
