obi:0000181 iao:0000111 "population"@en;
            iao:0000112 "PMID12564891. Environ Sci Technol. 2003 Jan 15;37(2):223-8. Effects of historic PCB exposures on the reproductive success of the Hudson River striped bass population."@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "a population is a collection of individuals from the same taxonomic class living, counted or sampled at a particular site or in a particular area"@en;
            iao:0000116 """1/28/2013, BP, on the call it was raised that we may want to switch to an external ontology for all populatin terms: 
