obi:0000223 iao:0000111 "Blinded medication"@en;
            iao:0000112 "Inert pill shaped like aspirin tablet"@en,
                        "115 patients received ipilimumab and blinded medication";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "Is a role which inheres in a material entity which is manufactured to be similar in appearance to a test material entity in e.g. a clinical trial to prevent participants from detecting which is the active and inactive substance";
            iao:0000116 "Will be modelled using a blinding process and specified output blinded medication instead";
