obi:0000260 iao:0000111 "plan"@en;
            iao:0000112 "The plan of researcher X to perform an experiment according to a protocol.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "A plan is a realizable entity that is the inheres in a bearer who is committed to realizing it as a planned process."@en;
            iao:0000116 "This class is included to make clear how the plan specification, the plan, and the planned process relate. OBI will however only subclass and work under the 'plan specification', and 'planned process' class, as we want to avoid to get deep into discussions of 'intend' etc.";
            iao:0000117 "AR, BP, JM, MC, PRS"@en;
            iao:0000119 "branch derived"@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "plan"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf pobo:BFO_0000017.
obi:0000264 iao:0000111 "sample population"@en;
            iao:0000112 "Patterns of benzylpiperazine/trifluoromethylphenylpiperazine party pill use and adverse effects in a population sample in New Zealand. Drug Alcohol Rev. 2008 Mar 31:1-7.  PMID: 18608458"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A sample population is an object aggregate that is selected from the population, e.g. the fish in the net that were sampled from the lake, the people that responded to the call for volunteers."@en;
            iao:0000116 "03/21/2010: BP, obsoleting this term, as it is duplicated by 'material sample'. Use that instead term instead, which now also has 'sample population' as an alternative label.";
