obi:0000457 iao:0000111 "manufacturing";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "Manufacturing is a process with the intent to produce a processed material which will have a function for future use. A person or organization (having manufacturer role) is a participant in this process"@en;
            iao:0000116 "This includes a single scientist making a processed material for personal use."@en,
