obi:0000680 iao:0000111 "whole organism preparation";
            iao:0000112 "putting a mouse in the blender. Not: putting a mouse on a scale";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "A material entity which is the output of a process in which one or more whole organisms are prepared in a way to make it easier to study them, and in which the great majority of organismal parts are maintained";
            iao:0000116 "does this include injecting a dye to a patient to be able to visualize parts of his brain? If not, we should state that the components of the organism are substantially re-arranged.";
            a owl:Class;
