obi:0000681 iao:0000111 "separation into different composition objective";
            iao:0000112 "The objective to obtain cells contained in a sample of blood.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A material separation objective aiming to separate a material entity that has parts of different types, and end with at least one output that is a material with parts of fewer types (modulo impurities).";
            iao:0000116 "We should be using has the grain relations or concentrations to distinguish the portioning and other sub-objectives";
            a owl:Class;
