            iao:0000112 "PMID: 19336255. RNA-Seq-quantitative measurement of expression through massively parallel RNA-sequencing. Wilhelm BT, Landry JR.Methods. 2009 Jul;48(3):249-57.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "is a DNA sequence which is manufactured by Illumina (Solexa) corporation. it support sequencing of single or paired end clone libraries relying on sequencing by synthesis technology";
            iao:0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
            iao:0000119 "Illumina Corporation";
