obi:0000788 iao:0000111 "fluorescently labeled MHC multimer";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "A complex of two or more linked MHC molecules including a fluorescent label that can be loaded with a ligand, and is used in flow cytometry assay to bind to T cell receptors of T cells specific for the ligand";
