            iao:0000112 "The presentation of a flashing light to a monkey during reward training";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "a planned process in which an organism is exposed to some stimulus with the intent to invoke an action";
            iao:0000117 "Helen Parkinson, Jessica Turner, Dirk Derom";
