obi:0000810 iao:0000111 "informed consent process";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "A planned process in which a person or their legal representative is informed about key facts about potential risks and benefits of a process and makes a documented decision as to whether the person in question will participate.";
            iao:0000116 "09/28/2009 Alan Ruttenberg: This is made a subclass of the higher level processual entity in BFO because I don't want to take a stand on whether it is a process aggregate. Analogous to the situation with Material entity.";
            iao:0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
            iao:0000119 "http://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/info/glossary#informed";
