obi:0000814 iao:0000111 "guar gum";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "Guar gum, also called guaran, is a galactomannan. It is primarily the ground endosperm of guar beans. The guar seeds are dehusked, milled and screened to obtain the guar gum.[1] It is typically produced as a free flowing, pale, off-white colored, coarse to fine ground powder.";
            iao:0000117 "Helen Parkinson";
            iao:0000119 "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guar_gum";
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "guar gum";
            rdfs:subClassOf pobo:BFO_0000040.
obi:0000815 iao:0000111 "Berichrom(r) Antithrombin III (A) Kit";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "For the chromogenic determination of antithrombin III. Autoanalyzer method for undiluted samples. For the quantitative chromogenic determination of the functional activity of antithrombin III in plasma on autoanalyzers for the diagnosis of diminished AT III synthesis, increased consumption, and for monitoring substitution therapy. Berichrom(r) Antithrombin III (A) is used for the rapid determination of the physiologically active antithrombin III and permits the diagnosis of congenital and acquired antithrombin III deficiency, a condition frequently associated with an increased risk of thrombosis. Acquired antithrombin III deficiencies frequently occur due to consumption following major operations or due to disseminated intravascular coagulation (DIC) in cases of septicaemia, nephroses, liver parenchymal damage (hepatitis, drug intoxication, alcoholism) and estrogen-containing contraceptives. The test permits early detection of patients at increased risk for thrombosis. Kit contains: 6 x for 5.0 mL Thrombin (bovine), 3 x for 3.0 mL Substrate Reagent, 1 x 30.0 mL Buffer Solution";
            iao:0000117 "Person:Alan Ruttenberg";
            iao:0000119 "WEB:http://www.dadebehring.com/edbna2/ebusiness/products/productDetail.jsp?sDiscipline=Hemostasis&FirstLevelOID=-13075&sCategory_Name=BCS&SecondLevelOID=-13895&ThirdLevelOID=-13904&selectedProductType=H-Assays+-+non+US&sProductName=OWWR15&PROD_OID=44198@2009/08/06";
            iao:0000232 "2009/09/28 Alan Ruttenberg. Fucoidan-use-case";
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "Berichrom(r) Antithrombin III (A) Kit";
            rdfs:subClassOf obi:0000047.
obi:0000816 iao:0000111 "micro electrode";
            iao:0000112 "A micro-electrode recording device used to record extracellular action potentialsin monkey caudate nucleus";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "An electrode of very fine caliber consisting usually of a fine wire or a glass tube of capillary diameter drawn to a fine point and filled with saline or a metal used in physiological experiments to stimulate or record action currents of extracellular or intracellular origin in the nervous system.";
            iao:0000117 "Helen Parkinson, Jessica Turner, Dirk Derom";
            iao:0000118 "micro electrode measuring device";
            iao:0000119 "Jessica Turner, Dirk Derom";
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "micro electrode";
