obi:0000861 iao:0000111 "Likelihood-ratio test";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "Likelihood-ratio is a data transformation which tests whether there is evidence of the need to move from a simple model to a more complicated one (where the simple model is nested within the complicated one); tests of the goodness-of-fit between two models.";
