J Nutr. 2010 Feb;140(2):382-91. Epub 2009 Dec 23.""";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "a protein extract is the output of an extraction process from tissues or cell cultures resulting in a solution of cellular and/or organellar proteins in buffer solution used to prevent degradation,";
