obi:0000909 iao:0000111 "cloacal specimen";
            iao:0000112 "type of sample used in the PCIRN influenza network";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 """A specimen obtained by inserting a swab deeply into the vent of the cloaca of
