obi:0000912 iao:0000111 "X-ray crystallography assay";
            iao:0000112 "Crystallizing an antibody:antigen complex, and recording the diffraction pattern of a synchrotron beam, and assembling the 3d complex structure based on homologous complexes.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A 3D structure determination assay in which the diffraction of pattern of X-ray beams in a crystal of purified material entities is used to resolve the 3-dimensional structure of the material entity of interest.";
