                                                                         a owl:Restriction] ; 
                                                     owl:onProperty obi:0000299 ; 
                                                     a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                 a owl:Class].
obi:0001146 iao:0000111 "binding assay";
            iao:0000112 "Determination of KD value for an antibody binding a protein using a BIACORE assay. Using plate bound antigen in an ELISA to determine if a mixture of serum antibodies bind the antigen. The following are NOT binding assays, as the desired output is not binding data: RNA microarray experiments to determine levels of gene expression. ChIP experiments to determine where in DNA a transcription factor binds. Using an IL-2 antibody on an ELISA plate to determine presence of IL-2 after stimulating a T cell culture.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000123;
            iao:0000115 "An assay with the objective to characterize the disposition of two or more material entities to form a complex.";
            iao:0000117 "Bjoern Peters",
                        "Randi Vita",
                        "Jason Greenbaum";
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "binding assay";
            rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0001181 ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000299 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            [owl:someValuesFrom [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0001588 ; 
                                                 owl:onProperty iao:0000136 ; 
                                                 a owl:Restriction] ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000299 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            obi:0000070.
obi:0001147 iao:0000111 "cell culture expansion"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "a processual entity that results in the increase of cell numbers"@en;
            iao:0000116 "including grow of yeast and bacteria"@en;
            iao:0000117 "PERSON: Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng"@en;
            iao:0000119 "MO_758 grow"@en;
            iao:0000232 """BP:
add it as subclass of 'cell culturing'
JZ:
No 'cell culturing' in OBI
Has term 'cell co-culturing' and  'maintaining cell culture'. Don't think either of it fit. So leave the term under process."""@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "cell culture expansion"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf obi:0000094,
                            [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000456 ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000417 ; 
