obi:0001404 iao:0000111 "genetic characteristics information"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "a data item that is about genetic material including polymorphisms, disease alleles, and haplotypes."@en;
            iao:0000117 "Person: Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng"@en;
            iao:0000119 "MO_66 IndividualGeneticCharacteristics"@en;
            iao:0000232 """MO definition:
The genotype of the individual organism from which the biomaterial was derived. Individual genetic characteristics include polymorphisms, disease alleles, and haplotypes.

examples in ArrayExpress
wild_type
MutaMouse (CD2F1 mice with lambda-gt10LacZ integration)
AlfpCre; SNF5 flox/knockout
p53 knock out
C57Bl/6 gp130lox/lox MLC2vCRE/+
fer-15; fem-1
df/df
pat1-114/pat1-114 ade6-M210/ade6-M216 h+/h+ (cells are diploid)
"""@en;
