obi:0001632 iao:0000111 "immuno staining assay";
            iao:0000112 "Detection of the presence of VCAM molecules on the surface of cells in a histology slide using an enzyme-linked antibody followed by enzyme activation to release a dye.";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A assay detecting a molecular label assay in which the label is attached to an antibody so that substances are marked based on the antibody's binding specificity.";
