            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A B cell epitope equilibrium dissociation constant (KD) assay that provides IC50 values determined under assay conditions where the IC50 approximates a KD value using a B cell epitope antigen inhibition of binding assay.";
