obi:0001913 iao:0000111 "computation run time"@en;
            iao:0000112 """Gigascience. 2012 Dec 27;1(1):18. doi: 10.1186/2047-217X-1-18.
PMID: 23587118. 

See Table 4"""@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 """computation run time is a time measurement datum which corresponds the time expressed in second, minute, hour necessary for a computer program to complete a process execution, for example genome assembly. It is an important metrics as it indicates the resource occupancy and computer program efficiency.
"""@en;
            iao:0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en,
