obi:0001945 iao:0000111 "scaffold N50"@en;
            iao:0000112 """Gigascience. 2012 Dec 27;1(1):18. doi: 10.1186/2047-217X-1-18.
PMID: 23587118. 

\"Here, the contig and scaffold N50 of the YH genome were ~20.9 kbp and ~22 Mbp\""""@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "N50 statistic computed for the scaffold produced by the assembly process. The method for computing the value is similar to that of contig N50 but uses scaffold information instead of contig information";
            iao:0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en,
                        "Alejandra Gonzalez-Beltran"@en;
            iao:0000119 "adapted from: nature:http://www.nature.com/nrg/journal/v13/n5/box/nrg3174_BX1.html"@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "scaffold N50"@en;
