                                                                     a owl:Restriction]) ; 
                                                 a owl:Class] ; 
                             owl:onProperty iao:0000136 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction].
obi:0001946 iao:0000111 "forward PCR primer"@en;
            iao:0000112 "SP6 promoter, forward primer (SP6 TTTAGGTGACACTATAG)"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "A short oligonucleotide complementary to target DNA (5'->3' on plus strand) that acts as the leader for DNA extension in a PCR reaction. The polymerase starts replication at the 3'-end of the primer, and copies the opposite strand. A primer is characterized by its 'melting temperature' (Tm) and pairs of primers should have similar Tm."@en;
