            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "Ion 316 Chip v2"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf obi:0001973.
obi:0001972 iao:0000111 "Ion 318 Chip v2"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 """An ion semiconductor chip manufactured by Life Technologies which detects polymerase-driven base incorporation to translate into digital form. The 318 chip is compatible with the Ion Torrent PGM and has a run time of:

4.4 hours for 200 bp reads with an output of 60 Mb-1 Gb,
7.3 hours for 400 bp reads with an output of 1.2 Gb-2 Gb."""@en;
