obi:0001978 iao:0000111 "immunoblot assay";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "An analyte assay that detects specific molecules in an input material by separating it using gel electrophoresis, transfering the separated molecules to a membrane, and staining them with_ antibodies specific to the analyte molecules.";
