obi:0002194 iao:0000111 "Microm Ergostar HM200";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "A microtome that is manufactured by Microm and uses a vertical cutting stroke common to all rotary microtomes engaged by a horizontal sliding movement. An operating arm replaces the handwheel and is attached to both sides of the instrument for greater convenience to permit control of sectioning from the left or right.";
