            rdfs:subClassOf obi:0500028.
obi:0002427 iao:0000111 "radiation treatment within the recent past exclusion criterion";
            iao:0000112 "An exclusion criterion defined by the pathologist is defined as whether the individual received  radiation therapy within the last two years. ";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "An exclusion criterion that defines whether radiation was received within a certain timeframe, which when met, makes an individual unsuitable for a given task or participation in a given process.";
            iao:0000117 "Chris Stoeckert, Helena Ellis";
