obi:0002457 iao:0000111 "precision nuclear run-on sequencing assay";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "An RNA-seq assay that maps the genome-wide distribution of transcriptionally-engaged Pol II at base-pair resolution by using biotin-labeled ribonucleotide triphosphate analogs (biotin-NTP) for nuclear run-on reactions, allowing the efficient affinity purification of nascent RNAs for high throughput sequencing from their 3' ends.";
