obi:0002570 iao:0000111 "nCounter Mouse miRNA Expression array";
            iao:0000112 """Kolbert, Christopher P., et al. \"Multi-platform analysis of microRNA expression measurements in RNA from fresh frozen and FFPE tissues.\" PloS one 8.1 (2013): e52517. PMID:23382819""";
