obi:0002598 iao:0000111 "inverse polymerase chain reaction";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "A polymerase chain reaction which amplifies DNA with only one known sequence from which primers may be designed. A series of restriction digestions and ligations result in a looped DNA fragment which can be primed for PCR.";
