obi:0302737 iao:0000111 "PCR-SSCP assay";
            iao:0000112 "PMID: 17334176.Hum Exp Toxicol. 2007 Jan;26(1):9-18.Is there a role for PCR-SSCP among the methods for missense mutation detection of TP53 gene?";
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "An assay that identifies DNA sequence variation (mutation, deletion, insertions) in target DNA sequences amplified using polymerase chain reaction using gel electrophoresis and denaturating conditions";
