obi:0302745 iao:0000111 "adipose tissue"@en;
            iao:0000112 "PMID: 18435934.Fatty acid composition of adipose tissue and blood in humans and its use as a biomarker of dietary intake.Prog Lipid Res. 2008 Apr 4."@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "adipose tissue is a tissue which main constituents are adipocytes. adipose tissue can be classified base on its location (site) but also based on adipocyte subtypes (brown or white) which reflect functional differences and is only found in animals, Vertebrates or invertebrates."@en;
            iao:0000117 "PERSON: Philippe Rocca-Serra";
            iao:0000119 "GROUP: OBI Biomaterial derived";
