            iao:0000114 iao:0000120;
            iao:0000115 "asphyxiation is a process by which oxygen supplies are restricted (by mechanical, e.g obstructing airways or chemical means, e.g. increasing CO2 partial pressure) resulting in termination of life in oxygen reliant organisms."@en;
            iao:0000117 "Philippe Rocca-Serra";
