            iao:0000112 "Helios Gamma Spectrophotometer"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000122;
            iao:0000115 "A spectrophotometer is an instrument that measures the intensity of light as a function of the color, or more specifically, the wavelength of light, transmitted by a substance."@en;
