                             owl:onProperty obi:0000293 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction].
obi:0600027 iao:0000111 "artificially induced cell membrane lysis"@en;
            iao:0000112 "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?cmd=Retrieve&db=PubMed&amp;list_uids=16080188&dopt=AbstractPlus; The destruction of cell membranes with detergent."@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "a material transformation to break the membranes of cells, releasing the cells contents; input=>cells; output=>cell_lysate"@en;
            iao:0000116 "---\\nThere is a more general 'membrane lysis', which could apply to artificial membranes etc. For this general membrane encapsulated objects would need to be defined."@en;
            iao:0000117 "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en;
            iao:0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "artificially induced cell membrane lysis"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf obi:0000094,
                            [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000456 ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000417 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction].
obi:0600028 iao:0000111 "artificially induced reverse transcription"@en;
            iao:0000112 "The use of M-MLV reverse transcriptase from the Moloney murine leukemia virus to transcribe an RNA sample into cDNA"@en;
            iao:0000114 iao:0000125;
            iao:0000115 "a protocol with the objective to transcribe single-stranded RNA into complementary DNA (cDNA)"@en;
            iao:0000116 "We need to indicate the relationship between the cDNA generated and the RNA that was used as a template. This may be outside of the OBI scope"@en,
                        "It could also be added that the reverse transcriptase is bearer of a GO:0003964 RNA-directed DNA polymerase activity, which is realized in this process.";
            iao:0000117 "PERSON:Kevin Clancy"@en;
            iao:0000119 "OBI branch derived"@en;
            a owl:Class;
            rdfs:label "artificially induced reverse transcription"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf [owl:someValuesFrom obi:0000419 ; 
                             owl:onProperty obi:0000293 ; 
                             a owl:Restriction],
                            obi:0000094,
