            iao:0000116 "The definition of this term is modeled after the Chebi:50967 and GO:0005488 terms. Further alignment of the logical definitions with those ontologies will require agreement on the placement of GO:molecular function in BFO among other things. OBI will retire this term once such an alignment is achieved as 'bound to' is not in the primary OBI scope.";
