ogms:0000063 iao:0000111 "disease course";
             iao:0000115 "The totality of all processes through which a given disease instance is realized."@en;
             iao:0000232 """replace 'OBI:occurrence of disease', need to add logical definition
The axioms of OBI occurence of disease:
Equivalent classes:
realizes some disease
Superclasses:
'has part' some 'pathologic process'
'has participant' some 
    (organism
     and ('has role' some 'host of immune response role'))
biological_process
realizes some 'host of immune response role'""";
             iao:0000412 pobo:ogms.owl;
             a owl:Class;
             rdfs:label "disease course";
             rdfs:subClassOf go:0008150;
             owl:equivalentClass [owl:someValuesFrom ogms:0000031 ; 
                                  owl:onProperty pobo:BFO_0000055 ; 
                                  a owl:Restriction].
